source: crates/bpmnkit-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8(out).unwrap()"
---
BPMN Kit command line

Usage: bpmnkit <COMMAND>

Commands:
  profile     Show profiles (read-only; other profile commands run in the legacy CLI)
  completion  Print a shell completion script
  plugin      Inspect plugins
  worker      Classify job types and (later) generate job workers
  self        Manage this installation
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version

Other commands run a `bpmnkit-<name>` plugin from PATH or <plugins dir>/bin, or fall
back to the legacy Node CLI (disable with BPMNKIT_NO_LEGACY=1). `casen` is an alias.
